cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "PhotoID RT: positioning photo documentation for radiation therapy"
message: >-
  If this software is useful in your work, a citation is appreciated.
  It is asked for, not required by the licence.
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "Braga"
    given-names: "Henrique Faria"
    website: "https://radioterapia.ai"
repository-code: "https://github.com/radioterapia-ai/photoid-rt"
url: "https://radioterapia.ai"
abstract: >-
  An Android application for photographic documentation of patient positioning
  in radiation therapy. It organises capture by category, builds the positioning
  sheet with its Time-Out page, and makes the images available during treatment.
  Optical character recognition and barcode reading are performed on-device by
  Google ML Kit, a third-party component; this project builds the accessibility
  layer around it. Not a medical device, and not validated for clinical use.
keywords:
  - radiation therapy
  - radiotherapy
  - patient positioning
  - clinical documentation
  - android
  - time-out
  - patient safety
license: Apache-2.0
